stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : kid registers (UC-006)
    pending --> approved : parent approves, active kid created (201)
    pending --> rejected : parent rejects (UC-009)
    approved --> approved : approve again, 409 already approved
    rejected --> rejected : approve, 409 already rejected
    pending --> pending : kid or no session, 403 or 401
    approved --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
